{
  "title": "Semantic Search",
  "story": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "6a46bc37dd15ddfb",
      "text": "Semantic search across every indexed domain this wiki can reach. Type a phrase \u2014 the plugin embeds it, compares it against the prebuilt page vectors, and ranks the closest pages by meaning rather than by word."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "833526e264c6916f",
      "text": "Here we search across the entire [[Farm]]:"
    },
    {
      "type": "similarity",
      "id": "ece1644752fdbfb5",
      "text": "*\nREPORT\nLIMIT: 10"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "6ceb4b9c37f3c06c",
      "text": "And here we search [[the federation]] (excluding our farm):"
    },
    {
      "type": "similarity",
      "id": "e659640772a8340b",
      "text": "GALAXY\nREPORT\nLIMIT: 10"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "id": "b8569a0e6aef5f8a",
      "text": "You may be interested in finding a suitable [[site]] on the farm, where these pages may live:"
    },
    {
      "type": "similarity",
      "id": "3cd8b0ef7d1c10ac",
      "text": "*\nSITES\nLIMIT: 5"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "3088fca5e9418d87",
      "text": "More [[About Similarity Plugin]]"
    }
  ],
